   "locked": false,
   "seed": 1072,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1072,
   "id": "t-1073",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Escalate by SLA: batch (minutes\u2013hours) \u2192 micro-batch (Spark, ~500 ms floor) \u2192 true streaming (Flink/Kafka Streams, 10\u2013100 ms)\nEvery step up is a permanent tax: state ops, checkpoints, watermark tuning \u2014 Beam makes bounded/unbounded a runtime choice",
   "originalText": "Escalate by SLA: batch (minutes\u2013hours) \u2192 micro-batch (Spark, ~500 ms floor) \u2192 true streaming (Flink/Kafka Streams, 10\u2013100 ms)\nEvery step up is a permanent tax: state ops, checkpoints, watermark tuning \u2014 Beam makes bounded/unbounded a runtime choice",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "containerId": "b-1072"
  },
  {
   "x": 60,
   "y": 664,
   "width": 951.02,
   "height": 20.900000000000002,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
